<SiteLayout title="skyfi :: a reading list">
	<main class="skyfi-page">
		<div class="skyfi-band">
			<p class="skyfi-intro">
				SkyFi is a mostly science fiction focused (with a mix of philosophy, music, horror, surrealism, and<br>
				post-modern literature) book club > made up of a group of people mostly based in new york city<br>
				who mostly operate in the field of architecture. The lists below are some of the books we have<br>
				read together and spinoffs they have inspired me to explore.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="skyfi-band">
			<section class="currently-reading">
				<p>Currently Reading :: October 2020</p>
				<p>Psuedo Fiction :: <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/2767052-staying-with-the-trouble" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Staying with the Trouble: Making Kin in the Chthulucene</a> by Donna Haraway</p>
				<p>Watching :: <a href="https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0118639/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Alien 3</a></p>
			</section>
		</div>

		<div class="skyfi-band">
			<section class="skyfi-books">
				<h1>SKYFI BOOKS :: EXTRA CURRICULAR</h1>
				<div class="two-column-layout">
					<div class="left-column">
						{leftCol.map(book => <p>{book}</p>)}
					</div>
					<div class="right-column">
						{rightCol.map(book => <p>{book}</p>)}
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</div>

		<div class="skyfi-band">
			<section class="skyfi-books">
				<h1>SKYFI :: BOOKS ON OUR RADAR (under construction)</h1>
				<div class="two-column-layout">
					<div class="left-column">
						{booksOnRadarLeft.map(book => <p>{book}</p>)}
					</div>
					<div class="right-column">
						{booksOnRadarRight.map(book => <p>{book}</p>)}
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
</SiteLayout>
